  <content>
  <section><para><emphasis><emphasis>Students will complete the following questions to practice the skills they have learned in this lesson.</emphasis></emphasis></para>
<para>1. The graphs show the distance, \(d\), traveled by two cars, A and B, over time, \(t\). Distance is measured in miles and time is measured in hours. </para>
<para><figure><media alt="Lines A and B on coordinate plane."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/d71d8dc6f83c6c24781699b463b8e5790cc17f77"/></media></figure></para>
<para>Which car traveled slower?</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>
    Car A
  </item>
  <item>
    Car B
  </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer: </emphasis>Car A traveled slower because Car B was a further distance in the same amount of time as car A:</para>
<para>For #2-5 use the graphs below to match each description of a situation in which the volume of water in a tank is a function of time to its corresponding graph. </para>

<div class="os-raise-d-flex os-raise-justify-content-between">
  <div class="os-raise-mx-auto">
    <para>Graph 1
      <figure><media alt="Graph on coordinate plane, no grid, Origin O. V shaped graph, line begins on Y axis, Vertex points down."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/6cc1b51e52fcacb2ed1d0724e6690e6cf5b54917"/></media></figure></para>
  </div>
  <div class="os-raise-mx-auto">
    <para>Graph 2
      <figure><media alt="Graph on coordinate plane, no grid, Origin O. Line begins at origin, moves upwards and to right. Steeper second segment."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/357be93d48a907c00f0d9b6d419adc447302cf1c"/></media></figure></para>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="os-raise-d-flex os-raise-justify-content-between">
  <div class="os-raise-mx-auto">
    <para>Graph 3
      <figure><media alt="Graph on coordinate plane, no grid, Origin O. V shaped graph, line begins on at origin, Vertex points up."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/c77becae591a5010e70ef56d22d0e13b4b6dd002"/></media></figure></para>
  </div>
  <div class="os-raise-mx-auto">
    <para>Graph 4
      <figure><media alt="Graph on coordinate plane, no grid, Origin O. Line begins at origin, moves upwards and to right, decreases briefly, then increases again."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/319837f6ca9d40f80bd22a7dae92190ef6ef2b3e"/></media></figure></para>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="os-raise-d-flex os-raise-justify-content-between">
  <div class="os-raise-mx-auto">
      <para>Graph 1
        <figure><media alt="Graph on coordinate plane, no grid, Origin O. V shaped graph, line begins on Y axis, Vertex points down."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/6cc1b51e52fcacb2ed1d0724e6690e6cf5b54917"/></media></figure></para>
    </div>
  <div class="os-raise-mx-auto">
    <para>Graph 2
      <figure><media alt="Graph on coordinate plane, no grid, Origin O. Line begins at origin, moves upwards and to right. Steeper second segment."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/357be93d48a907c00f0d9b6d419adc447302cf1c"/></media></figure></para>
  </div>
</div>


<div class="os-raise-d-flex os-raise-justify-content-between">
  <div class="os-raise-mx-auto">
    <para>Graph 3
      <figure><media alt="Graph on coordinate plane, no grid, Origin O. V shaped graph, line begins on at origin, Vertex points up."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/c77becae591a5010e70ef56d22d0e13b4b6dd002"/></media></figure></para>
  </div>
  <div class="os-raise-mx-auto">
    <para>Graph 4
      <figure><media alt="Graph on coordinate plane, no grid, Origin O. Line begins at origin, moves upwards and to right, decreases briefly, then increases again."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/319837f6ca9d40f80bd22a7dae92190ef6ef2b3e"/></media></figure></para>
  </div>
